WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.467
-We have exactly
11 shows left before

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.167
we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.467
that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:08.901
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:11.434
-♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:15.033
♪ 11 days left ♪

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.534
-That's right -- every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:19.701
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:22.067
a marvelous Christmas sweater
from the

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:24.467
Countdown to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:30.868
Now, since there are 11 shows
left, let's open door number 11.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:33.701
You ready? You ready?

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:34.767
Go for it.
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.567
Ooh!
[ Laughs ]

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:39.033
♪♪

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:40.534
Wow.

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:43.167
Wow.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.200
-Wow!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.367
-Alright. Now let's see
who's going home with

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.501
tonight's Christmas sweater.

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:51.901
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:55.133
If I call your number, get up,
scream, come on down here,

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:56.167
and get ready for your
new Christmas sweater.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:57.234
Who wants one?

00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:58.367
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.367
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.133
428!

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.300
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.267
-Whoa!

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:10.934
♪♪

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.634
-What's going on?

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:27.234
Coming in -- coming in hot
right now.

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:28.634
You're coming in hot.
-I hope that was my number.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:31.033
-You knew it was your number.
Yeah. Hi. How you doing?

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:32.133
-I'm good, Jimmy. How are you?
I'm Joe.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.167
-Joe, nice to meet you.

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:34.834
Welcome, Joe.
Where are you from?

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.734
-From Navarre, Florida.

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:38.300
Originally from
Western New York. Go, Bills.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.868
-Are you really?
Welcome back to New York.

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:41.000
Thanks for coming to
the show tonight.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.767
-Absolutely.
-Do you have anything like this?

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:44.434
Well, you do.
-Not at all. I do now.

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.167
-You do now.
Would you like to try it on?

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:47.501
-I would love to.
-Yeah.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.033
I'll hold your sweater for you.

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:51.334
♪♪
There you go.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:53.901
-It's a lot heavier than I --
-Yeah, it's a hefty --

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:55.467
-Oh, yeah.
-It's like two sweaters in one.

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:56.501
-I'm sweatin' already.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.200
-Yeah, no,
you're gonna love this.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.434
This is good.

00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:01.400
It's got good shoulders
in there for you, too.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:05.133
-Oh, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.734
-Yeah!

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.534
Joe, you look good, bud.
Look at you.

00:02:09.534 --> 00:02:10.868
-That looks awesome.
-Look at that.

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:12.501
You look good, right?
-Couple handsome guys we are.

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:14.467
-Yeah, I like that.
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.734
Joe, thank you very much.
Nice to see you.

00:02:16.734 --> 00:02:17.934
Give it up for Joe.
Stick around.

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.000
We got more "Tonight Show"
after the break.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.901
♪♪

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.801
Coming running out?

